# Route: guide 50 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to 60, 22
# quests, 1.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Westfall, Duskwood, Moonglade, Azshara, Swamp of Sorrows, Burning
# Steppes, Arathi Highlands): Sentinel Hill -> Moonbrook -> Sentinel Hill ->
# Moonbrook -> Sentinel Hill -> The Dagger Hills -> Sentinel Hill -> The
# Hushed Bank -> Darkshire -> Manor Mistmantle -> Darkshire -> Moonglade ->
# Ravencrest Monument -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Morbent Fel (55; Morbent Fel 32).
#
# Left out: Uniting the Shattered Amulet (3627): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Defias Brotherhood
# (166), The Unsent Letter (373), Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and
# Punishment (377), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), The
# Heart of the Mountain (4123), Marshal Windsor (4241), Incendius! (4263), Put
# Her Down (4701), Egg Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Doomrigger's
# Clasp (4764), Maxwell's Mission (5081), General Drakkisath's Demise (5102).

